      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Fantoche. Shuppet se alimenta de sentimentos como inveja e maldade. Seu chifre capta as emoções das pessoas. Quanto mais sombrios forem os sentimentos de tristeza e ódio ao seu redor, mais forte ele se torna.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Amorfo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Shuppet pode evoluir para Banette no nível 13 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Astonish, Knock Off</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Screech</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Night Shade</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Spite</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Shadow Sneak</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Will-O-Wisp</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Feint Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Hex</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Curse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Shadow Ball</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Embargo, Role Play</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Sucker Punch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Snatch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Grudge, Trick</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Phantom Force</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Ally Switch, Attract, Calm Mind, Charge Beam, Confide, Confuse Ray, Curse, Dark Pulse, Dazzling Gleam, Double Team, Dream Eater, Embargo, Encore, Endure, Facade, Foul Play, Frustration, Gunk Shot, Helping Hand, Hex, Hidden Power, Icy Wind, Imprison, Knock Off, Lash Out, Magic Coat, Magic Room, Metronome, Nasty Plot, Night Shade, Pain Split, Payback, Phantom Force, Poltergeist, Pounce, Protect, Psybeam, Psych Up, Psychic, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Role Play, Round, Scary Face, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Skill Swap, Skitter Smack, Sleep Talk, Snatch, Snore, Spite, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Taunt, Telekinesis, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Torment, Toxic, Trick, Trick Room, Will-O-Wisp</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Astonish, Confuse Ray, Destiny Bond, Disable, Foresight, Gunk Shot, Imprison, Ominous Wind, Phantom Force, Pursuit, Shadow Sneak</p>",
